                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Following their fourth meeting the Foreign Ministers temporarily adjourned until
                    Monday, September 18, in order to participate in the fifth session of the NATO
                    Council. For documentation on the Council meetings, see <ref target="#pg85"
                        >pages 85</ref> ff.</p>
            </div>
